{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4nXadLwRvR7GMGctbM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Dust falls from hinges that haven't moved in centuries.*\n\n*A thin seam of light appears — widening, widening — revealing nothing but a blinding white threshold.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*What I hold beyond me is only what you bring through.*\n\n*Step forward, or step away. I will not choose for you. I will not close until you have decided.*\n\n*The light waits.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}